{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aFly to Butterfly Valley\u300b</strong>\u00a0is a point-and-click interactive picture book game that features childlike crayon hand-drawn graphics and piano lilting music, as players also take on the role of a magical girl experiencing a healing, yet somewhat melancholic, story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The magical girl will embark on a journey along with the flight of the butterflies, meeting new friends and having new adventures on the journey, which will have an impact on another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn crayon art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melodious music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological intertwining of two worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique emotional interaction design</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750540?t=1747710752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750540/c46cd4c2ca41e12c32c169a55ce3258f6287a504/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747710752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750540/5f2bfa1ea1934e987b1876bdda3b39bbc37473ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747710752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750540/5f2bfa1ea1934e987b1876bdda3b39bbc37473ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747710752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aFly to Butterfly Valley\u300b</strong>\u00a0is a point-and-click interactive picture book game that features childlike crayon hand-drawn graphics and piano lilting music, as players also take on the role of a magical girl experiencing a healing, yet somewhat melancholic, story.</p><p class=\"bb_p